FRAME orbit_resource(const char*k){if(!k)return NULL;for(int i=0;i<sizeof(resources)/sizeof(resources[0]);i++)if(!strcmp(k,resources[i].key)){drawables[i].Frame=frames+resources[i].base;drawables[i].MaxIndex=resources[i].count-1;return drawables[i].Frame;}return NULL;}
COUNT GetFrameIndex(FRAME f){return f?f->Index:0;}
COUNT GetFrameCount(FRAME f){return f&&f->parent?f->parent->MaxIndex+1:1;}
FRAME SetAbsFrameIndex(FRAME f,COUNT i){if(!f)return NULL;return f->parent->Frame+(i%GetFrameCount(f));}
FRAME SetRelFrameIndex(FRAME f,SIZE i){int n=GetFrameCount(f),index=(GetFrameIndex(f)+i)%n;if(index<0)index+=n;return SetAbsFrameIndex(f,index);}
FRAME IncFrameIndex(FRAME f){return SetRelFrameIndex(f,1);}
FRAME DecFrameIndex(FRAME f){return SetRelFrameIndex(f,-1);}
FRAME SetEquFrameIndex(FRAME f,FRAME g){return SetAbsFrameIndex(f,GetFrameIndex(g));}
BOOLEAN GetFrameRect(FRAME f,RECT*r){if(!f)return FALSE;r->extent=f->Bounds;r->corner.x=-f->HotSpot.x;r->corner.y=-f->HotSpot.y;return TRUE;}
BOOLEAN TFB_DrawImage_Intersect(TFB_Image*a,POINT ap,TFB_Image*b,POINT bp,const RECT*r){if(!a||!b)return FALSE;for(int y=r->corner.y;y<r->corner.y+r->extent.height;y++)for(int x=r->corner.x;x<r->corner.x+r->extent.width;x++){int ax=x-ap.x,ay=y-ap.y,bx=x-bp.x,by=y-bp.y;if(ax<0||ay<0||bx<0||by<0||ax>=a->w||ay>=a->h||bx>=b->w||by>=b->h)continue;int ai=ay*a->w+ax,bi=by*b->w+bx;if((a->bits[ai>>3]&(1<<(ai&7)))&&(b->bits[bi>>3]&(1<<(bi&7))))return TRUE;}return FALSE;}